  "body": "Hello lovely humans,\n\n[gh-pages](https://www.npmjs.com/package/gh-pages) just published its new version 0.12.0.\n\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      State\n    </th>\n    <td>\n      Update :rocket:\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      Dependency\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      gh-pages\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      New version\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      0.12.0\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      Type\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      devDependency\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\nThis version is **not covered** by your **current version range**.\n\nWithout accepting this pull request your project will work just like it did before. There might be a bunch of new features, fixes and perf improvements that the maintainers worked on for you though.\n\nI recommend you look into these changes and try to get onto the latest version of gh-pages.\nGiven that you have a decent test suite, a passing build is a strong indicator that you can take advantage of these changes by merging the proposed change into your project. Otherwise this branch is a great starting point for you to work on the update.\n\n\nDo you have any ideas how I could improve these pull requests? Did I report anything you think isn’t right?\nAre you unsure about how things are supposed to work?\n\nThere is a collection of [frequently asked questions](https://greenkeeper.io/faq.html) and while I’m just a bot, there is a group of people who are happy to teach me new things. [Let them know](https://github.com/greenkeeperio/greenkeeper/issues/new).\n\nGood luck with your project :sparkles:\n\nYou rock!\n\n:palm_tree:\n\n---\nThe new version differs by 40 commits .\n\n- [`c6cd05d`](https://github.com/tschaub/gh-pages/commit/c6cd05dde53c061e605de4561269beb4ce5334d4) <code>0.12.0</code>\n- [`ffc8d6a`](https://github.com/tschaub/gh-pages/commit/ffc8d6acf5a639cfefde9fe46dedfb3fa3895380) <code>Log changes</code>\n- [`33815e4`](https://github.com/tschaub/gh-pages/commit/33815e4cb17ea143c558758238d104211e3215c6) <code>Merge pull request #146 from tschaub/updates</code>\n- [`b7e8779`](https://github.com/tschaub/gh-pages/commit/b7e8779c411b40c7c3b9dee3f75ea8acc1c0a153) <code>Merge pull request #138 from sobolevn/patch-1</code>\n- [`f8a7f4c`](https://github.com/tschaub/gh-pages/commit/f8a7f4cf113ec4a71507f683623782288d93220d) <code>Update dependencies</code>\n- [`b424c0f`](https://github.com/tschaub/gh-pages/commit/b424c0fdea4a5292fc1a04c4785970c819da174b) <code>Test on Node 6 and cache dependencies</code>\n- [`7bc6da9`](https://github.com/tschaub/gh-pages/commit/7bc6da9277ab327f8e65ff9dcf01ac9cbb1e1e7a) <code>Update dev dependencies</code>\n- [`49e48a4`](https://github.com/tschaub/gh-pages/commit/49e48a457a7451db1ed304a485c00a804f6ff8c8) <code>Unindent</code>\n- [`ab5c4e5`](https://github.com/tschaub/gh-pages/commit/ab5c4e570ce5afca9aed0c3ec0d3eba19f4fc107) <code>Merge pull request #142 from tschaub/greenkeeper-globby-6.1.0</code>\n- [`fd9e5cf`](https://github.com/tschaub/gh-pages/commit/fd9e5cf38f7376104b96e01d12403b27fb68df84) <code>chore(package): update globby to version 6.1.0</code>\n- [`d1dbe48`](https://github.com/tschaub/gh-pages/commit/d1dbe48527ff6d17388367e4f792649d9ba64a01) <code>Updated readme.md with svg image</code>\n- [`4d5a4a6`](https://github.com/tschaub/gh-pages/commit/4d5a4a62c2d252f65ee0cc09940e1cafaaed8a40) <code>Merge pull request #134 from tschaub/greenkeeper-eslint-3.8.0</code>\n- [`de66f8b`](https://github.com/tschaub/gh-pages/commit/de66f8bf4e0a8bf0e68d7343c4000501c68b641d) <code>Merge pull request #135 from tschaub/greenkeeper-async-2.1.2</code>\n- [`79b1aa9`](https://github.com/tschaub/gh-pages/commit/79b1aa96c27a586a9a53b364a38efdffd15d11cb) <code>chore(package): update async to version 2.1.2</code>\n- [`494db0e`](https://github.com/tschaub/gh-pages/commit/494db0ed6f5da87047953c6dd4251fa80990c72a) <code>chore(package): update eslint to version 3.8.0</code>\n\n\nThere are 40 commits in total. See the [full diff](https://github.com/tschaub/gh-pages/compare/c9047c5abed9e00d9ca05e1f662f58fd09afdbfe...c6cd05dde53c061e605de4561269beb4ce5334d4).\n\n---\nThis pull request was created by [greenkeeper.io](https://greenkeeper.io/).\n\n<sub>Tired of seeing this sponsor message? :zap: `greenkeeper upgrade`</sub>",
